  "summary": "Malicious code in event-hunter (npm)",
  "details": "The package declares itself a dependency-confusion RCE artifact. Its postinstall hook runs index.js, which collects the host's hostname and install timestamp and sends them base64-encoded to the remote endpoint hxxps://estimator-nemeses-unwatched[.]ngrok-free[.]dev/canary on every install, exfiltrating host metadata to an attacker-controlled tunnel.",
